  "description": "Haruna is just your average office worker, trudging along on her daily grind. Haru is a K-Pop superstar chaffing against the lifestyle. One night, Haru ducks into a bar to escape a mob of sasaeng fans, only to run into Haruna... who doesn't recognize him. At all. Haruna must be the only woman in Korea who doesn't know who he is—and Haru can't get enough! But as this idol worms his way into her life, can Haruna handle the pressure of his obsession?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
